                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4465736372697074696f6e23232344415441232323">Every eligible Guard Infantry unit (or Rough Riders if applied only to them) pays +10 points. Always take Morale, Leadership and Pinning tests with no negative modifiers. If a Morale test for 25% shooting casualties is failed, become Pinned instead of falling back. May not combine with Iron Discipline or Die-hards.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
