          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4465736372697074696f6e23232344415441232323">Counts as an HQ choice. If more than 8 models are taken including Schaeffer and Kage it also counts as one Troops choice; if more than 16 are taken it counts as two Troops choices. Last Chancers may not be upgraded by Doctrines.</characteristic>
